# libpdx-font .gitignore
#
# build-out/ is the compile-check product directory (tools/build.sh);
# object/binary/archive artifacts must never enter version control.
#
# NOTE: unlike most sibling repos this one does NOT blanket-ignore
# `*.bin` — assets/fonts/glyphs_8x16.bin is a vendored SOURCE asset
# (the 8x16 glyph table Font8x16 embeds via @include_bytes), not a
# build product. If a future edit adds a build-out/*.bin artifact,
# scope its ignore to build-out/ specifically rather than reinstating
# a repo-wide *.bin rule that would silently untrack the font asset.

# Build products
build-out/
*.o
*.elf
*.a
*.so
*.so.*

# Editor / OS noise
*~
.DS_Store

# Local scratch
.scratch/
